 "kind": "clarify",
 "message": "I can't start onboarding for Kwame Asante yet. I searched the directory for \"Kwame Asante\" and \"Asante\" and found no record. Under POL-ONB-01, onboarding requires a directory record with status pre_start, and if there isn't one, HR has to create it first.\n\nCould you ask HR to create his pre_start record? Once it exists, let me know (or reply with his employee ID) and I'll start onboarding. Note that onboarding can start no earlier than 5 business days before the start date, so for a Monday start it can be filed from the week of 2026-11-09 onward; today (Tuesday 2026-11-17) is within that window.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ONB-01"
 ]
}
